[PrintTextModified Text:パン、パンパンッと<br>続け様に銃弾が撃たれてくる。|#0102Adv05_Narrative035| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Surprised1,ArmR8,ArmL7

[PrintTextModified Text:ぎょええええええぇ！！|#0102Adv05_Miria013| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:もはや乙女の素養を失った汚い悲鳴で<br>ミリアが逃げ惑う。|#0102Adv05_Narrative036| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Fearful1,ArmR8,ArmL7

[PrintTextModified Text:"撃たれた！！ 撃たれたあああ！！<br>死ぬうううううぅ！！|#0102Adv05_Miria014|" AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR18,ArmL13

[PrintTextModified Text:落ち着いてくださいミリアさん！<br>当たってません！|#0102Adv05_Sherry018| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:ナノカちゃん！？|#0102Adv05_Ema023| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:姿の見えないナノカが<br>どこかから狙撃してきたのだろう。|#0102Adv05_Narrative037| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"エマは<ruby=\"とっさ\">咄嗟</ruby>に周囲に視線を巡らすが、<br>ナノカの姿は見つけられない。|#0102Adv05_Narrative038|" RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Angry1,ArmR3,ArmL7

